Package: qualcomm-iqfiles-qcs9075
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: qcom-chicdk-qcs9100,
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: tuned Qualcomm QCS9075 camera IQ files
 This package provides tuned Qualcomm camera IQ data for QCS9075 camera
 sensors. Existing vendor files are replaced through reversible dpkg
 diversions, while new IQ files are added to the CamX runtime directory.
